          "href": "https://bresslergroup.egnyte.com/dl/yjjKonosqq"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0022",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Mike Gadsby, CXO and Co-founder, Lauren Slattery, Head of UX Strategy, and Dan Laufer, Developer of O3 World: The three of them talked about how O3 infuses innovation into everyday projects through the ",
          "_key": "k0023"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0003"
          ],
          "text": "O3 Labs",
          "_key": "k0024"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " program and how we validate and make this work for clients.",
          "_key": "k0025"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0003",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.o3world.com/labs/"
