          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0004"
          ],
          "text": "Anatoly Polinsky",
          "_key": "k0027"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Director of Zeros and Ones, Chariot Solutions: He discussed how the world of blocks and chains works and what it really means for Chariot’s clients. More in his ",
          "_key": "k0028"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0005"
          ],
          "text": "slides",
          "_key": "k0029"
        },
