          "marks": [
            "k0006"
          ],
          "text": "Brett Bagenstose",
          "_key": "k0032"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", The Baron of Pixels, Neo-Pangea: To round out our day, Brett discussed how his team uses WebVR to bring the technology to more people in a simpler way.",
          "_key": "k0033"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
