    {
      "_key": "k0034",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Thanks to all our speakers who made Innovation Day a huge success. Also, special shoutout to ",
          "_key": "k0035"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0007"
          ],
          "text": "La Colombe",
          "_key": "k0036"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " who sponsored our event and provided coffee the morning of the talks! We’re already looking forward to next year’s tech week!",
          "_key": "k0037"
        }
      ],
